osperity to human race.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXTRAS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomised enemy compositions.</strong>\u00a0Enemies who can deflect bullets, shapeshifters, enemy artillery, bosses &amp; more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Curses!</strong> The enemy will periodically curse the battlefield with tactical effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adapt.</strong> Cobble together a build from a choice of randomised perks and cards each battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reinforcements.</strong> Employ mercenaries and heavy support units to join you on heavily infested planets.</p></li></ul>",
